{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A lonesome crawdad mired in debt, you vie to topple the loan sharks and robber barons who run your neck of the bayou. Leverage 100+ upgrades as you battle and bet your way through a dozen colorful bosses in this Game Boy-style roguelike boss rush. Erase your debts once and for all!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sling your trusty machete and rusty harpoon with\u00a0<i>Breakout</i>-inspired toss-catch mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge over a dozen bosses to fast-paced, ambidextrous combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression system featuring 100+ unique upgrades!\u00a0Your build is in your hands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your machete, electrify your harpoon, and punish your foes with status effects like Poison, Bleed, Hex, and Frost. Grow your upgrade pool across subsequent runs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time and money wisely as you fight to stay afloat in the Bayou's predatory economy. The vig on your debts grows daily!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk it all at the casino, or visit the bookie to make high-stakes parlay bets on your performance in boss fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in Time Attack mode to unlock powerful rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful player choice and multiple endings put you in control of your destiny!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit aesthetics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a49b1b169464323e3c64d2629d2db781.poster.avif?t=1767736695\" width=638 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a49b1b169464323e3c64d2629d2db781.webm?t=1767736695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a49b1b169464323e3c64d2629d2db781.mp4?t=1767736695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806790?t=1767736695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806790?t=1767736695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/50247f5ceea17a6a3af29e54dce643e992892b44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767736695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/50247f5ceea17a6a3af29e54dce643e992892b44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767736695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3961390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A lonesome crawdad mired in debt, you vie to topple the loan sharks and robber barons who run your neck of the bayou. Leverage 100+ upgrades as you battle and bet your way through a dozen colorful bosses in this Game Boy-style roguelike boss rush. Erase your debts once and for all!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sling your trusty machete and rusty harpoon with\u00a0<i>Breakout</i>-inspired toss-catch mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge over a dozen bosses to fast-paced, ambidextrous combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression system featuring 100+ unique upgrades!\u00a0Your build is in your hands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your machete, electrify your harpoon, and punish your foes with status effects like Poison, Bleed, Hex, and Frost. Grow your upgrade pool across subsequent runs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time and money wisely as you fight to stay afloat in the Bayou's predatory economy. The vig on your debts grows daily!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk it all at the casino, or visit the bookie to make high-stakes parlay bets on your performance in boss fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in Time Attack mode to unlock powerful rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful player choice and multiple endings put you in control of your destiny!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit aesthetics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a49b1b169464323e3c64d2629d2db781.poster.avif?t=1767736695\" width=638 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a49b1b169464323e3c64d2629d2db781.webm?t=1767736695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a49b1b169464323e3c64d2629d2db781.mp4?t=1767736695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Bokoyoss Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/7020e69aeda0b2084494ce6cfd8bfde12656e5c6/header.jpg?t=1767736695","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3806790